WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.330
It was Tom's birthday.

2
00:00:08.331 --> 00:00:14.279
"Happy Birthday!" Mrs. Twitchit said.

3
00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:24.620
She gave Tom a gift.

4
00:00:24.621 --> 00:00:27.972
Tom opened his gift.

5
00:00:27.973 --> 00:00:30.332
"A new ball!"

6
00:00:30.333 --> 00:00:38.413
The ball was bright yellow.

7
00:00:38.414 --> 00:00:41.964
"Let's go play catch," Mittens said.

8
00:00:41.965 --> 00:00:44.385
"Fun!" Tom said.

9
00:00:44.386 --> 00:00:48.531
"You can go outside," Mrs. Twitchit said.

10
00:00:48.532 --> 00:00:50.312
"But don't go far.

11
00:00:50.313 --> 00:01:07.879
Tom's party is at three o'clock."

12
00:01:07.880 --> 00:01:17.932
The kittens went outside.

13
00:01:17.933 --> 00:01:21.392
They played catch with the ball.

14
00:01:21.393 --> 00:01:24.455
"Throw the ball to me!" Moppet said.

15
00:01:24.456 --> 00:01:27.190
She held up her paws.

16
00:01:27.191 --> 00:01:31.974
She jumped up and down.

17
00:01:31.975 --> 00:01:34.284
Tom threw the ball.

18
00:01:34.285 --> 00:01:36.331
Moppet missed.

19
00:01:36.332 --> 00:01:41.080
The ball landed behind a big bush.

20
00:01:41.081 --> 00:01:43.640
Moppet looked at Mittens.

21
00:01:43.641 --> 00:01:46.220
"Can you get the ball?"

22
00:01:46.221 --> 00:01:48.769
"No!" Mittens said.

23
00:01:48.770 --> 00:01:51.072
"You're the one who missed it!"

24
00:01:51.073 --> 00:01:53.654
Moppet put her paws on her hips.

25
00:01:53.655 --> 00:01:56.087
"Tom is the one who threw it!

26
00:01:56.088 --> 00:02:00.597
Tom, go get the ball!"

27
00:02:00.605 --> 00:02:06.014
The kittens fought for a while.

28
00:02:06.015 --> 00:02:13.345
Finally Tom went to get the ball.

29
00:02:13.346 --> 00:02:16.048
He peeked behind the bush.

30
00:02:16.049 --> 00:02:22.962
Tom gasped. "My ball is gone!"

